3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2020 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2021-01-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ken Goldman","x":"You've said in the past, I think pretty strongly, that you don't have much desire to accept and pass on manufacturers' price increases right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/13/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2020 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2021-01-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bob Dimond","x":"As a result, we are increasing our outlook for the full fiscal 2020 as follows: identical sales in fiscal 2020 to be approximately 16.5% versus prior guidance of at least 15.5%; adjusted EPS in the range of $3.05 per share to $3.15 per share versus previous expectations of $2.75 to $2.85 per…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/13/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2020 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2021-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"Now, when it comes -- if it goes beyond that 3% to 4%, then here's what's going to happen, we are going to be -- we're going to have difficult conversations on how much we can accept because we're not going to pass through all of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/26/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2020 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2021-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Robbie Ohmes","x":"And maybe even to that, a lot of the CPG companies have obviously been talking about pushing through, you know, a fair amount of price increases this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/26/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2020 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2021-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"We improved our picking software, optimizing, and standardizing the picking process to drive cost reduction through increased picks per hour and improved order prioritization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/26/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2020 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2021-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"The additional $500 million in savings is principally driven by new projects related to the transformation of our supply chain and the additional cost reduction programs and further optimization of our promotional spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/26/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2021 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"While we are seeing higher cost inflation in some categories, we saw modest inflation during Q1, and we were generally successful in passing it through as the competitive environment has remained rational.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2021 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"This is something we can pass through, and we get a lot of leverage when it gets into that range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2021 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2021-10-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sharon McCollam","x":"Given the outperformance in Q2 and recent trends, we have updated and raised our guidance for fiscal-year 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/18/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2021 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2022-01-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"When we think about what we are passing through, the net-net, we have passed through -- the inflation, we have passed through is less than the inflation we've incurred, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/11/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2021 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2022-01-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"And the way we do that is to make sure that we are judicious about the categories where we pass it through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/11/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2021 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2022-01-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sharon McCollam","x":"Given our outperformance in Q3 and recent trends, we are raising our guidance for fiscal '21.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/11/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2022 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2022-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Kessler","x":"And then thinking about the pass through of higher costs into retail pricing, how that's going, if there's any change in how you're viewing that past or dynamic, and what you're seeing from the competition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2022 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2022-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vivek Sankaran","x":"But I think some CPGs are coming forward with price increases later in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2022 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2022-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sharon McCollam","x":"But today we are just beginning the investment in the Albertsons Media Collective, and then the modernization of our supply chain, which is going to bring us substantial cost savings in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/albertsons-companies-inc-aci-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2025-07-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Carden","x":"And then on tariffs, I know that indirect impacts","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/15/albertsons-aci-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2025-07-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"Looking for alternate sources of supply or other products that we can push if the tariffs become unwieldy and then finally in certain cases, if we have to, we'll pass them on to customers but we're gonna remain very close to the competitive set, especially on key items.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/15/albertsons-aci-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2025-07-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"We also surgically manage through the pass-through of cost inflation to further invest in the customer's needs for immediate value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/15/albertsons-aci-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2025-07-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"We've worked hard and it and it showed that our price as well that we've not passed through all of the inflation that we're seeing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/15/albertsons-aci-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2025-07-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"At the same time, we're working to negotiate contracts that are not only financially responsible but also provide the operational flexibility the company needs to streamline operations, manage costs, and offer affordable prices in a rapidly changing grocery landscape.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/15/albertsons-aci-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2025-10-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"At the same time, our digital investments, including AI-powered features, are driving engagement, customer acquisition, and retention.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/14/albertsons-aci-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2025-10-14","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sharon McCollam","x":"And finally, as it relates to tariffs, tariffs have not had a material impact on our financial performance yet this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/14/albertsons-aci-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2025-10-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"And looking at what we can take to our offshore businesses again, to cost savings, but also to enhance our capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/14/albertsons-aci-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2025-10-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Leah Jordan","x":"And then as we think about this year, what about cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/14/albertsons-aci-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2026-01-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"We drove bold decisions in our Tech and AI transformation, purposeful investments to strengthen our customer value proposition, and accelerated execution in digital and pharmacy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/07/albertsons-aci-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2026-01-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"Our advanced cloud data infrastructure provides the foundation for scaling AI solutions and business processes across the enterprise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/07/albertsons-aci-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2026-01-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"We also very carefully managed the pass-through of inflation to deliver value for customers across the entire company ensuring affordability while protecting margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/07/albertsons-aci-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2026-01-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"Well, many ways, but three of them are our investments in loyalty, our investments in, pulling forward on promotion, base price investments, and then how we're managing through inflation we're working very hard to soften the pass-through of inflation to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/07/albertsons-aci-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2026-01-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"In pharmacy, where growth continues to accelerate, we're streamlining fulfillment and procurement to improve cost to serve while also enhancing the customer experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/07/albertsons-aci-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2026-01-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Edward Kelly","x":"And then just a follow-up I was hoping maybe you could talk about the progress of the cost savings and how you're tracking so far against the plan, and the cadence in terms of savings as you think about 2026?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/07/albertsons-aci-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q3","e":"aci","d":"2026-01-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"But within the lower guide, it's still implying a fairly wide range for the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/07/albertsons-aci-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2026-04-14","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sharon McCollam","x":"In addition, we saw a greater moderation in GLP-1 growth, driven by tighter payer criteria and increased direct-to-consumer penetration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/albertsons-aci-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2026-04-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"As part of our investments in supply chain, we've launched Gateway, a proprietary AI-powered tool that boosts inventory efficiency and replenishment for promotional center store SKUs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/albertsons-aci-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2026-04-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sharon McCollam","x":"In order of these priorities, we invested $1.84 billion in capital expenditures in fiscal '25 to modernize our store fleet, advance our AI, digital and technology capabilities and elevate our supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/albertsons-aci-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2026-04-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"That said, you should know that we have not been passing through that inflation at the 2% rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/albertsons-aci-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2025 Q4","e":"aci","d":"2026-04-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"We've made some pretty significant investments in restructuring the team, in cost negotiation improvements, while also amplifying -- we're certainly protecting the quality that we have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/albertsons-aci-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2026-07-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sharon McCollam","x":"Consistent with these priorities, in Q1, we invested $522 million in capital expenditures related to the modernization of our store fleet, including 4 new stores as well as continued investment in our technology and AI capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/albertsons-aci-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2026-07-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Susan Morris","x":"Beyond these investments, we're embedding AI across the company to improve decision-making to automate workflows and enhance productivity at scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/albertsons-aci-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2026-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Carden","x":"And then how should we think about the potential timing of some of the supplier price increases that you mentioned?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/albertsons-aci-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2026-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Lejuez","x":"And how much of that cost inflation do you think you'll be able to pass through to consumers versus have to absorb?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/albertsons-aci-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2026-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Susan Morris","x":"We do believe in ACI Edge, both the reorganization of the company, the centralization of center store and service of rightsizing the value proposition that is in need of adjustment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/albertsons-aci-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q1","e":"aci","d":"2026-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Susan Morris","x":"We're being very clear today with our goals on rightsizing our value proposition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/albertsons-aci-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2026-10-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Feldman","x":"I'm assuming AI is some part of that, but do you need to have that infrastructure improved before even getting to where you want to be?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/13/albertsons-aci-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2026-10-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"Some of our cost takeout and in-store execution began to yield results in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/13/albertsons-aci-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACI 2026 Q2","e":"aci","d":"2026-10-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Susan Morris","x":"Earlier this year, we increased our cost savings program from 1.5 billion to $2 billion over the next three years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/13/albertsons-aci-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[44,1,10387,0,0,0,9102,897],[45,1,10268,0,0,0,8148,1659],[46,1,10802,0,0,0,8284,1959],[47,1,9897,0,0,0,7934,1555],[48,1,9006,0,0,0,7044,1496],[49,1,9509,0,0,0,7582,1470],[50,1,9405,0,0,0,7545,1320],[62,1,9018,0,0,0,8821,0],[63,1,8763,0,0,0,7041,1186],[64,1,8986,0,0,0,7131,1503],[65,1,8690,0,0,0,7116,1267],[66,1,8799,0,0,0,2094,6398],[67,1,8478,0,0,0,4439,3421]],"cinema":[[44,1,10387,0,0,0,9102,897],[45,1,10268,0,0,0,8148,1659],[46,1,10802,0,0,0,8284,1959],[47,1,9897,0,0,0,7934,1555],[48,1,9006,0,0,0,7044,1496],[49,1,9509,0,0,0,7582,1470],[50,1,9405,0,0,0,7545,1320],[62,1,9018,0,0,0,8821,0],[63,1,8763,0,0,0,7041,1186],[64,1,8986,0,0,0,7131,1503],[65,1,8690,0,0,0,7116,1267],[66,1,8799,0,0,0,2094,6398],[67,1,8478,0,0,0,4439,3421]],"imax":[[44,1,10387,0,0,0,9102,897],[45,1,10268,0,0,0,8148,1659],[46,1,10802,0,0,0,8284,1959],[47,1,9897,0,0,0,7934,1555],[48,1,9006,0,0,0,7044,1496],[49,1,9509,0,0,0,7582,1470],[50,1,9405,0,0,0,7545,1320